#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:40
msgid "Cylindrical Fence Failsafe"
msgstr "圆柱形围栏失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:40
msgid "Inclusion/Exclusion Fence Failsafe"
msgstr "包含/排除围栏失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:7
#: 1bafe897afa5458198242133dde9fd6d
msgid "Fences"
msgstr "围栏"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:10
#: 373627ba829a4aeeabe7631df3867f57
msgid ""
"ArduPilot supports a home based Cylindrical (\"TinCan\") and Polygonal "
"and/or Cylindrical, Inclusion and/or Exclusion regions. Inclusion and "
"Exclusion Fences are defined easily in Mission Planner under the PLAN "
"screen and loaded to the autopilot, using the FENCES item in the drop "
"down box, just like Missions or Rally Points are planned."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 支持基于 Home 点的圆柱形（「锡罐」）围栏，以及多边形和/或圆柱形的包含和/或排除区域。包含和排除围栏可在 Mission"
" Planner 的 PLAN 界面中轻松定义并上传到飞控，使用下拉框中的 FENCES 项目，与任务或集结点的规划方式相同。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:12
#: cf63a51cc5254f36995e2d91f99d8aeb
msgid ""
"Some vehicles can also have maximum and/or minimum altitude limits. Some "
"flight modes will try to prevent exceeding these limits automatically, a "
"fence breach will be declared in all modes if exceeded."
msgstr "某些飞行器还可以设置最大和/或最小高度限制。某些飞行模式会尝试自动防止超出这些限制，若超出则在所有模式下声明围栏突破。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:14
#: 6f8e3cd1ed164564b95353c4b7408b34
msgid "Upon Fence breach, selectable actions are taken."
msgstr "围栏突破后，将执行可选的动作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:17
#: a9e8badeafea4de699a7ead7603c4319
msgid "General Setup"
msgstr "通用设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:19
#: 807860ecb5f641dabc486067a065e09a
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`FENCE_ENABLE<FENCE_ENABLE>` = 1 to enable fences. This enables "
"any fences that are setup, except the ALT_MIN fence, which must be "
"enabled by using any fence enable means (GCS message, AUTOENABLE in "
"plane, RC switch)"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`FENCE_ENABLE<FENCE_ENABLE>` = 1 以启用围栏。这将启用所有已设置的围栏，但 ALT_MIN "
"围栏除外，ALT_MIN 围栏必须通过任何围栏启用方式（GCS 消息、固定翼中的 AUTOENABLE、遥控开关）启用"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:20
#: 03c9076896474bc9b68366dbd361145b
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`FENCE_ACTION<FENCE_ACTION>` = to whatever you wish for a breach"
" action. These will vary depending on vehicle type. See "
":ref:`fence_breach_actions` above."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`FENCE_ACTION<FENCE_ACTION>` = 设置为您希望的突破动作。这些动作因飞行器类型而异。请参见上方的 "
":ref:`fence_breach_actions`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:21
#: 00548b7ae9e140a3bff7a5cfeb18c56e
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`FENCE_OPTIONS<FENCE_OPTIONS>` to \"1\" to prevent mode changes "
"after a fence breach until the vehicle returns within the fence boundary "
"(Plane only, Copter/Rover do not allow mode changes while in breach)"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`FENCE_OPTIONS<FENCE_OPTIONS>` "
"设为「1」，以在围栏突破后阻止模式切换，直到飞行器返回围栏边界内（仅限固定翼，Copter/Rover 在突破期间不允许模式切换）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:22
#: 482b97d3ba1d41f1a7a13caaf42666c2
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`FENCE_ALT_MAX<FENCE_ALT_MAX>` = to the altitude limit you want "
"(in meters). This is unavailable in Rover."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`FENCE_ALT_MAX<FENCE_ALT_MAX>` = 设置为您想要的高度限制（以米为单位）。此选项在 Rover "
"中不可用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:23
#: 9e0506801c5043ac9aa2616ef76c8e6e
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`FENCE_MARGIN<FENCE_MARGIN>` = to the distance from the fence "
"horizontal boundary the vehicle must maintain in order to prevent a "
"breach."
msgstr "将 :ref:`FENCE_MARGIN<FENCE_MARGIN>` = 设置为飞行器必须与围栏水平边界保持的距离，以防止突破。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:24
#: 156a112579ea4ea18f1747bed5b6aba7
msgid ""
"Set the :ref:`FENCE_ALT_MIN<FENCE_ALT_MIN>` as a minimum altitude breach "
"boundary."
msgstr "将 :ref:`FENCE_ALT_MIN<FENCE_ALT_MIN>` 设为最低高度突破边界。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:25
#: 7cf18c939f7d402aaa81656071825e69
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`FENCE_AUTOENABLE<FENCE_AUTOENABLE>` = (Plane Only)to allow "
"automatic enabling of the fence (different than "
":ref:`FENCE_ENABLE<FENCE_ENABLE>`) under certain vehicle conditions, such"
" as upon arming or takeoff. A value of 0 disables this feature. "
":ref:`FENCE_ENABLE<FENCE_ENABLE>` is ignored if this feature is enabled. "
"Using :ref:`FENCE_AUTOENABLE<FENCE_AUTOENABLE>` = 3 (enable on ARM) is "
"the only recommended use. \"1\" or \"2\" functions are being deprecated "
"shortly since they can produce undesirable results in terms of "
"containment."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`FENCE_AUTOENABLE<FENCE_AUTOENABLE>` "
"=（仅限固定翼）设置为在特定飞行器状态下（如解锁或起飞时）自动启用围栏（与 :ref:`FENCE_ENABLE<FENCE_ENABLE>` "
"不同）。值为 0 禁用此功能。启用此功能后 :ref:`FENCE_ENABLE<FENCE_ENABLE>` 将被忽略。建议仅使用 "
":ref:`FENCE_AUTOENABLE<FENCE_AUTOENABLE>` = "
"3（解锁时启用）。「1」或「2」功能因可能产生不理想的包含效果而即将废弃。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:26
#: 3283b34464dc4bbab33547769700f2b7
msgid ""
":ref:`FENCE_RET_RALLY<FENCE_RET_RALLY>` allows returning to the nearest "
"RALLY point (See: :ref:`common-rally-points`), if loaded, instead of "
"HOME."
msgstr ""
":ref:`FENCE_RET_RALLY<FENCE_RET_RALLY>` 允许返回最近的集结点（见 :ref:`common-rally-"
"points`）（如已加载），而非 Home 点。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:27
#: 8f7e7d0e3e3745ecb1e2c9ff6947e395
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`FENCE_TYPE<FENCE_TYPE>` = is a bitmap set to enable the various"
" fence types: MIN or MAX altitude, simple CIRCLE tin can around HOME, or "
"POLYGON fences. The POLYGON fences must also have been loaded via a fence"
" list from a ground control station in order to be active. See below for "
"detailed setup of :ref:`common-ac2_simple_geofence` and :ref:`common-"
"polygon_fence`."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`FENCE_TYPE<FENCE_TYPE>` = 设为位图以启用各类型围栏：最低或最高高度、以 Home "
"为中心的简单圆柱（锡罐）围栏，或多边形围栏。多边形围栏还必须通过地面站的围栏列表加载才能激活。详细设置请参见 :ref:`common-"
"ac2_simple_geofence` 和 :ref:`common-polygon_fence`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:29
#: 261177998fcd40c09fdc815f691ebcfd
msgid ""
"Polygon fence type includes the circular fences specified in the "
"Inclusion/Exclusion fence list. The simple home centered CIRCLE fence is "
"a separate fence. Rover ignores altitudes, if set."
msgstr "多边形围栏类型包含包含/排除围栏列表中指定的圆形围栏。以 Home 为中心的简单圆形围栏是独立的围栏。Rover 忽略高度设置（如已设置）。"

