msgstr "Copter 动作"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:85
#: f62b0801e47c4ac1bd24efb6d41777fb
msgid ""
"Copter will stop increasing altitude at "
":ref:`FENCE_ALT_MAX<FENCE_ALT_MAX>` in Loiter, PosHold, and AltHold "
"modes."
msgstr ""
"Copter 在 Loiter、PosHold 和 AltHold 模式下，将在 "
":ref:`FENCE_ALT_MAX<FENCE_ALT_MAX>` 处停止增加高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:87
#: 1af7bc3b161d43efb5e6d6e75aa17bd6
msgid ""
"In Loiter mode, it will try to stop at the horizontal boundaries, but "
"declare a breach if exceeds the boundary."
msgstr "在 Loiter 模式下，将尝试在水平边界处停止，但若超出边界则声明突破。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:89
#: 72ffd4ec388343bb904b22e3b49aab4b
msgid ""
"In other modes, it will execute the :ref:`FENCE_ACTION<FENCE_ACTION>` "
"below if the altitude or boundary is reached."
msgstr "在其他模式下，如果达到高度或边界，将执行以下 :ref:`FENCE_ACTION<FENCE_ACTION>`。"

