#: cc27e95d09da47aba64fd2d3a60c1fc2
msgid ""
"RTL/HOLD,etc. means it will attempt RTL first, but if it can't switch to "
"that mode (ie for RTL, GPS lock is lost), it will attempt to switch to "
"the next,in this case HOLD."
msgstr "RTL/HOLD 等表示将首先尝试 RTL，但如果无法切换到该模式（如 RTL 需要 GPS 锁定已丢失），则尝试切换到下一个，本例中为 HOLD。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:109
#: 0dcaa166dffc4778a75eb660fbf84da2
msgid ""
"If :ref:`common-object-avoidance-landing-page` is setup, RTL actions will"
" attempt to avoid any fences as it returns."
msgstr "如果设置了 :ref:`common-object-avoidance-landing-page`，RTL 动作将在返回途中尝试避开任何围栏。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:111
#: 1325eacf7672414596e0416d398a8880
msgid ""
"At the moment the fence is breached a backup fence is erected 20m further"
" out (or up).  If the vehicle breaches this backup fence (for example if "
"the vehicle is not set up correctly or the operator takes control but is "
"unable to bring the copter back towards home), the vehicle will execute "
"the :ref:`FENCE_ACTION<FENCE_ACTION>` again (and another backup fence an "
"additional 20m further out will be created if this is breached again)."
msgstr ""
"在围栏突破的瞬间，将在距离更远（或更高）20m 处建立备用围栏。如果飞行器突破此备用围栏（例如飞行器配置不正确或操作员接管控制但无法将飞行器带回 "
"Home），飞行器将再次执行 :ref:`FENCE_ACTION<FENCE_ACTION>`（如果再次突破，将在另外 20m "
"外创建另一个备用围栏）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:117
#: 128288dfce324f9cbfa0edfecb0b2d88
msgid ""
"If the vehicle eventually proceeds 100m outside the configured fence "
"distance, despite the backup fences, the vehicle will switch into LAND "
"mode (HOLD for Rover).  The idea being that it's clearly impossible to "
"get the vehicle home so best to just bring it down/stop it.  The pilot "
"can still retake control of course with the flight mode switches.  Like "
"with the earlier fences, another fence is erected 20m out which will "
"again switch the vehicle to LAND (HOLD for Rover), if it continues away "
"from home."
msgstr ""
"如果飞行器最终在配置围栏距离外飞行了 100m，尽管有备用围栏，飞行器将切换到 Land 模式（Rover 为 "
"HOLD）。理由是此时显然已无法将飞行器带回 "
"Home，最好直接让其降落/停止。飞行员当然仍可通过飞行模式开关重新接管控制。与之前的围栏一样，另一个围栏将在 20m 外建立，如果飞行器继续远离"
" Home，将再次将其切换到 Land（Rover 为 HOLD）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:126
#: 8176ac057ac245cebe703283caf17a8b
msgid "Enabling the Fence with an RC Channel Auxiliary Switch"
msgstr "通过 RC 通道辅助开关启用围栏"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:128
#: be4377abe8aa47cc9a627ed35d655de7
msgid ""
"It is not necessary to set-up a switch to enable or disable the fence but"
" if you wish to control the fence with a switch follow these steps:"
msgstr "不必设置开关来启用或禁用围栏，但如果希望用开关控制围栏，请按以下步骤操作："

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:132
#: b997b5af2a1149f7a4091f16fb43b3c1
msgid ""
"An ``RCx_OPTION`` can be set via the Config/Tuning > Full Parameter List "
"screen, for example using RC channel 7:"
msgstr "可通过 Config/Tuning > Full Parameter List 界面设置 ``RCx_OPTION``，例如使用 RC 通道 7："

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:134
#: c5c0ee5d099b4aa6a158a5424397de50
msgid "Set :ref:`RC7_OPTION<RC7_OPTION>` = 11 (Fence Enable)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`RC7_OPTION<RC7_OPTION>` = 11（围栏启用）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:135
#: 0991f9734fa3407582c46e76ad40a689
msgid ""
"setting the switch high (i.e. PWM > 1800) will enable all configured "
"fences, low (under 1800) will disable all fences."
msgstr "将开关拨高（即 PWM > 1800）将启用所有已配置的围栏，拨低（低于 1800）将禁用所有围栏。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:138
#: b2b0d6bdf604445a9fd6cfd7564b8d40
msgid ""
"if the Minimun Altitude fence is enabled by the switch while on the "
"ground and disarmed, a pre-arm failure will occur preventing arming."
msgstr "如果在地面且未解锁时通过开关启用最低高度围栏，将发生解锁前失败，阻止解锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:141
#: 35e0af467e6f4fecac5358b3a07db3fb
msgid "Automatic Altitude Breach Avoidance"
msgstr "自动高度突破规避"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:143
#: f68b0a36feae466da3a6d1a27f0e6f1a
msgid ""
"For landing modes (NAV_LAND,QLAND,LAND,etc.) in Copter and Plane, the "
":ref:`FENCE_ALT_MIN<FENCE_ALT_MIN>` limit is automatically disabled."
msgstr ""
"对于 Copter 和固定翼的降落模式（NAV_LAND、QLAND、LAND "
"等），:ref:`FENCE_ALT_MIN<FENCE_ALT_MIN>` 限制将自动禁用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:148
#: 7038cc2a6e284a87b62b8f074d7ab7a4
msgid ""
"altitude control imperfections can still result in a breach unless the "
":ref:`FENCE_MARGIN<FENCE_MARGIN>` param is loose enough to accommodate "
"these imperfections."
msgstr "高度控制不完善仍可能导致突破，除非 :ref:`FENCE_MARGIN<FENCE_MARGIN>` 参数足够宽松以适应这些不完善之处。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:152
#: 0e7b18fd2d834352a197e457649c67c9
msgid "Enabling Fences in Mission Planner"
msgstr "在 Mission Planner 中启用围栏"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:154
#: 6880b87281d6462c968bfcc361bc1f59
msgid ""
"To enable Fences, go to the Mission Planner full parameter list "
"(CONFIG->Full Parameter Tree), search for items with ``FENCE_``:"
msgstr ""
"要启用围栏，请进入 Mission Planner 完整参数列表（CONFIG->Full Parameter Tree），搜索带 "
"``FENCE_`` 的项目："

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:168
#: df3f2c7081c94f74934d81aef16311a3
msgid "Use for R/C Training"
msgstr "用于 RC 训练"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:170
#: aec2037dfe434c4a8effbd8ae773c71e
msgid ""
"One of the main uses of geo-fencing is to teach yourself (or someone "
"else) to fly radio controlled vehicles. When you have a properly "
"configured geo-fence it is very hard to crash, and you can try manoeuvres"
" that would normally be too likely to end in a crash, trusting the "
"autopilot to 'bounce' the vehicle off the geo-fence before the flight "
"ends in disaster."
msgstr "地理围栏的主要用途之一是教自己（或他人）驾驶遥控飞行器。当您正确配置了地理围栏后，坠机变得非常困难，您可以尝试平时风险太高的动作，信任飞控会在飞行灾难发生前将飞行器「弹回」地理围栏内。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:177
#: 1e780a9c431248c9a204a85f5e4d6ba6
msgid ""
"Geo-fencing can be combined with any flight mode. So for a raw beginner, "
"you would combine it with one of the stabilised flight modes . Once the "
"pilot has gained some confidence you could combine it with ACRO mode in "
"Copter or MANUAL mode in Plane, which gives direct control of the vehicle"
" and allows for the most interesting aerobatic manoeuvres."
msgstr ""
"地理围栏可与任何飞行模式结合使用。对于初学者，可与某种增稳飞行模式结合使用。当飞手获得一定信心后，可与 Copter 中的 Acro "
"模式或固定翼中的 MANUAL 模式结合使用，这可直接控制飞行器并允许最有趣的特技动作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:184
#: c76993c00523445cb7ee38fc6b301e08
msgid "MAVLink support"
msgstr "MAVLink 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:186
#: 74f3de97dafa46bcb79bddc9e6c78bde
msgid ""
"ArduPilot will report the fence status via the MAVLink GCS protocol. The "
"key status packet is called FENCE_STATUS, and is defined in "
"\"ardupilotmega.xml\". A typical FENCE_STATUS packet looks like this:"
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 将通过 MAVLink GCS 协议报告围栏状态。关键状态数据包称为 "
"FENCE_STATUS，在「ardupilotmega.xml」中定义。典型的 FENCE_STATUS 数据包如下所示："

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:194
#: 5864a9de8a864c1e8808fba0d1afa976
msgid ""
"The breach_status field is 0 if inside the fence, and 1 if outside. The "
"breach_count is how many fence breaches you have had on this flight. The "
"breach_type is the type of the last breach (see the FENCE_BREACH enum in "
"ardupilotmega.xml). The breach_time is the time in milliseconds of the "
"breach since APM was booted."
msgstr ""
"breach_status 字段在围栏内时为 0，在围栏外时为 1。breach_count 是本次飞行中围栏突破的次数。breach_type "
"是最近一次突破的类型（见 ardupilotmega.xml 中的 FENCE_BREACH 枚举）。breach_time 是自 APM "
"启动以来突破发生的时间（毫秒）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:200
#: 593b75735ada417cbcf695931910bead
msgid ""
"The MAV_SYS_STATUS_GEOFENCE bit of the MAV_SYS_STATUS_SENSOR portion of "
"the SYS_STATUS message indicates whether or not the geo-fence is "
"breached.  As of this writing only the MAVProxy GCS recognizes this "
"status bit and reports the status of the geo-fence.  In the future the "
"Mission Planner, APM Planner, and other GCS applications should get "
"support for announcing geo-fence status during the flight."
msgstr ""
"SYS_STATUS 消息的 MAV_SYS_STATUS_SENSOR 部分中的 MAV_SYS_STATUS_GEOFENCE "
"位指示地理围栏是否被突破。截至本文撰写时，仅 MAVProxy GCS 识别此状态位并报告地理围栏状态。未来 Mission "
"Planner、APM Planner 和其他 GCS 应用程序应获得在飞行期间宣布地理围栏状态的支持。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:207
#: 6bdad23bff9d40cc83803659d01f596b
msgid ""
"The MAV_CMD_DO_FENCE_ENABLE MAVLink command message allows a GCS to "
"enable or disable a fence interactively.  As of this writing only "
"MAVProxy supports this message using the \"fence enable\" or \"fence "
"disable\" commands.  In the future Mission Planner, APM Planner, and "
"other GCS applications may get support for interactively enabling and "
"disabling the geo-fence without needing to use a manual transmitter."
msgstr ""
"MAV_CMD_DO_FENCE_ENABLE MAVLink 命令消息允许 GCS 以交互方式启用或禁用围栏。截至本文撰写时，仅 "
"MAVProxy 支持此消息，使用「fence enable」或「fence disable」命令。未来 Mission Planner、APM "
"Planner 和其他 GCS 应用程序可能会获得无需使用手动遥控器即可交互式启用和禁用地理围栏的支持。"

